  "summary_en": "Japan's Road Act (1952, current revision 2026) governs road designation, management, structure, occupancy, conservation and penalties. It includes limited provisions on automated-operation support facilities for vehicles with automated driving devices as road appurtenances and permits their occupancy by designated entities.",
  "key_provisions_or_claims": [
   "Defines 'automated operation support facilities' for vehicles with automated driving devices as road appurtenances (Art. 2).",
   "Road occupancy permits cover automated operation support facilities (Art. 32).",
   "Permits occupancy by entities promoting automated driving for public transport and logistics (Art. 33).",
   "Allocates road management among MLIT, prefectures and municipalities.",
   "Includes decarbonization of roads and disaster road-clearing plans."
